OL,3,GNEWSAKent winemaker turns to carbon
OL,4,Acapture technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent winemaker using carbon dioxide
OL,7,Fcapture technology in a bid to be more
OL,8,Fsustainable says it is "the right thing
OL,9,Fto do".
OL,11,FDefined Wine Ltd in Patrixbourne, near
OL,12,FCanterbury, has installed a unit that
OL,13,Fcaptures CO2 produced during the grape
OL,14,Ffermentation process which can then be
OL,15,Freused.
OL,17,FCEO Henry Sugden aims to use the
OL,18,Fcaptured CO2 on site and sell any
OL,19,Fexcess to other producers, and claims
OL,20,Fto be the first UK winemaker using the
OL,21,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
