OL,3,GNEWSAKent winemaker turns to carbon
OL,4,Acapture technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the company wanted to try it in
OL,7,Forder to "not increase the pace of
OL,8,Fclimate change". "It's the right thing
OL,9,Fto do," he added.
